---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy — Penida-Go" description="Privacy policy regarding customer booking data at Penida-Go.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p>Penida-Go values and protects your privacy. This policy outlines how we handle personal communication and booking records.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Data Collected</h2>
      <p>We only collect information necessary to execute your transfer: your name, pickup/dropoff address, travel date, contact phone number, and flight numbers for airport transfers.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Usage of Data</h2>
      <p>Your details are shared solely with your assigned driver to coordinate pickup. We never sell or distribute your contact details to third-party marketing services.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
